MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Establish a base.
- Penetrate the CCA defenses.
- Capture the star port relic.

ENGINEERING REPORT:
Our engineering team has developed armored personnel carriers (APC) to help take out the base's fixed emplacements. The APC's have no weapons, but they have bio-metal armor that will equally distribute damage across the craft. They will withstand substantial damage when transporting troops into position for attacking hardened targets.
